{"id":"vod_zy360_67579","vodId":"67579","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"罪恶王冠","name_cn":"罪恶王冠","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全22集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241104-1/b52d3977291075ceba96eb9114da8771.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2029年，被病毒袭击的日本陷入了混乱之后被名为“GHQ”的暴力组织全面接手，政府逐渐成为了傀儡。在这样动荡的大环境下，樱满集（梶裕贵配音）只是一名平凡的高中生，过着属于他的平凡生活，直到那个叫做楪祈（茅野爱衣配音）的少女出现在他的眼前。祈的真实身份为“葬仪社”的成员，这个社团以从GHQ的手上夺回日本自治权为目标不断进行着危险而残酷的战争。在组织首领恙神涯（中村悠一配音）的引导之下，集成为了组织的一员，结识了同僚筱宫绫濑（花泽香菜配音）和鸫（竹达彩奈配音）等人。随着战斗的升级，各种迹象显示出集似乎拥有着神秘的力量，而躲在诸多敌人背后的究竟是怎样强大的存在，众人无从而知……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-04 10:12:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/w2YKv2r8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/J2S68fde/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/QcgsJiec/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/8FcGTIcS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/wES8FAnX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/xnDIZGOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/PyxT3HEE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/wVRFEfav/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/gPHilGks/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/Xh7jQTPK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/FEz7Ghlx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/Vw7rHDo5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/YI3F0C6Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/edDEWLwg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/slcZ